    "## Step 1: Data Preparation\n",
    "\n",
    "### Normal Traffic\n",
    "We collect normal traffic from a simulated consumer IoT network over the course of 10 minutes. There are three devices: a security camera, a blood pressure monitor, and a smart outlet. There is also an Android phone to control these devices; the phone also serves as a Wi-Fi link for uploading data to the Internet, as is the case for the Bluetooth-connected blood pressure monitor."
   ]
