   "source": [
    "#### Device 3 (Android Phone) Attack Profile\n",
    "\n",
    "Because the device performs three attacks at three different times in the trace, we subdivide the trace according to time interval to get dataframes with the specific attacks.\n",
    "\n",
    "Attack 1: UDP Flood, 105 seconds, 5-120 sec\n",
    "Attack 2: TCP SYN Flood, 80 seconds, 240-320 sec\n",
    "Attack 3: HTTP GET Flood, 115 seconds, 420-535 sec"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "metadata": {
