   "source": [
    "## Step 2: Generate Features and Labels\n",
    "\n",
    "The next step is to generate features and labels (1 = attack, 0 = normal) for each device.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Note**: This approach assumes a constant set of features that is not protocol-specific."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 11,
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {
